{"problem_id": "26c8d230-fe86-4fe1-9f27-2f34b23ac1b6", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 9, "items": [{"at": "2026-08-27T10:15:02.268138+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:02:03.252917+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+ax+b\"></span> . Най­ди­те <i>a</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:02:03.252917+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем дан­ную функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{kx+a}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb+a-kb}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb}{x+b}+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}=k+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  1, зна­чит, <i>k</i>  =  1. Гра­фик функ­ции имеет вер­ти­каль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>x</i>  =  −4, зна­чит, <i>b</i>  =  4. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(1)  =  2, тогда</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"1+\\frac{a-4}{1+4}=2\\iff \\frac{a-4}{5}=1\\iff a-4=5\\iff a=9\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": []}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:02:03.252917+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:02:03.252917+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:02:03.252917+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/a5b006fc-7e86-4be5-8ac3-9eda959d5da2\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+ax+b\"></span> . Най­ди­те <i>a</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">9</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем дан­ную функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{kx+a}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb+a-kb}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb}{x+b}+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}=k+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  1, зна­чит, <i>k</i>  =  1. Гра­фик функ­ции имеет вер­ти­каль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>x</i>  =  −4, зна­чит, <i>b</i>  =  4. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(1)  =  2, тогда</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"1+\\frac{a-4}{1+4}=2\\iff \\frac{a-4}{5}=1\\iff a-4=5\\iff a=9\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}